7	/**
8	 * Sets {@code householdSize} to the number of members the owner's household has after this create:
9	 * every existing owner sharing the same household plus the owner being created. The household is now
10	 * the deterministic {@link HouseholdId} derived from the last name and postcode, so two owners belong
11	 * to the same household exactly when they share a {@code householdId} — the same rule duplicate
12	 * detection ({@link RejectDuplicateOwner}) uses. Runs before the owner is saved, so
13	 * {@link OwnerRepository#findAll()} sees only the owners that existed before this create, which are then
14	 * counted alongside this one.
15	 */
16	public class CountHousehold {
